Vendored from Mailgun Talon
===========================

This directory contains a minimal subset of the Mailgun Talon library
(https://github.com/mailgun/talon), pinned to commit:

  71d9b6eb78e985bcdfbf99b69c20c001b4b818c4

License: Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE in this directory).

Files included (quotations + bruteforce signature extraction only):
  - constants.py
  - utils.py
  - html_quotations.py
  - quotations.py
  - signature/constants.py
  - signature/bruteforce.py

Modifications from upstream:
  - Package imports rewritten from ``talon.*`` to relative imports under
    ``app.llm._vendor.talon``.
  - Removed unused ``from six.moves import range`` (Python 3 builtin).
  - Minimal ``__init__.py`` files that do not import the ML classifier tree.
